Z||000000||JSocha||04-11-2001||07:37 PM||||1. I can't reach my license unless you hold my beer. (This is OK in Texas)<P>2. Sorry, Officer, I didn't realize my radar detector wasn't plugged in.<P>3. Aren't you the guy from the Village People?<P>4. Hey, you must've been doin' about 125 mph to keep up with me. Good job!<P>5. Are You Andy or Barney?<P>6. I thought you had to be in relatively good physical condition to be a police officer.<P>7. You're not gonna check the trunk, are you?<P>8. I pay your salary!<P>9. Gee, Officer! That's terrific. The last officer only gave me a warning, too!<P>10. Do you know why you pulled me over? Okay, just so one of us does.<P>11. I was trying to keep up with traffic. Yes, I know there are no other cars around. That's how far ahead of me they are.<P>12. When the Officer says "Gee Son....Your eyes look red, have you been drinking?" You probably shouldn't respond with,"Gee Officer your eyes look glazed, have you been eating doughnuts?"||||reg||10
