Z||000029||Logic||04-16-2001||06:30 AM||||Officer - I'm writing you a ticket for going 65 in a 45.<P>You - Whew,  I thought it was going to be for the 10 feet of rubber I planted when I took off.<P>-------------------------------------------<P>Officer - Can I see your license and registration.<P>You - Here hold my beer while I get it out.<P>----------------------------------------<P>Officer - Do you have any idea why I pulled you over?<P>You - Yeah, but you should of pulled over that mustang instead.  He's the one that lost.    <P>Logic ||||reg||1
